# Parsed chapter artefacts. The blocks ARE the chapter text and the assets are
# page crops: quarantined content, FORBIDDEN_PENDING_RIGHTS_RECORD (§5, Q3).
# A local commit is not publication, but history outlives the decision to push.
# Regenerate with scripts/assemble_*_quarantine.py + scripts/compose_*.py.
artifacts/*-quarantine/

# Vectors of quarantined chapter text. Regenerate with
# scripts/embed_representations.py; the cache is keyed by text hash.
artifacts/embeddings/
